#: winnifred_waterheater/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "WATER HEATER"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Whatever you need, I ain't got."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/3
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "We're all out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/11
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You made that pretty clear."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/19/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm actually here for Stella."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still boiling I see."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "What can I say. You have that effect on me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh my."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That bad?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Stella never asks for anything."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seems she's pretty desperate."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a little sad to watch."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Truly. She's selfless that one. Silly, but selfless. The best and worst kind."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Is it this... Airway thing?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yea."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Unfortunately."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh Stella..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'll sign up."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Someone needs to keep an eye on her."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_recruit/0/g-2/32/b/1
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And it sure as hell shouldn't be you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Normally you try to avoid dealing with your water heater—you're no plumber, after all."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But as you look at the beauty standing where your water heater usually is, you wonder for a moment if that's about to change."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Beyond the rigid metal of the heater lie dangerous curves, brown skin swathed in orange and blue and silver. Her soft, pretty facial features are adorned by colorful makeup that looks like it wouldn't be out of place in a fashion magazine."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She doesn't seem to notice you at first, but when she does she lets out a sharp scream."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "AHHHH!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "AH!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "AHH!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Bubblin' boiler rooms, you scared the livin'..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes her a moment to calm herself down—she fans at her face with her hands, exhaling loudly."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Got me flustered, is all. I wasn't expecting any visitors."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Last folks who lived here only came down when the pilot light was out. Which wasn't often. See, I'm made of the good stuff. Southern made and made to last."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look like you are quality!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh... I hadn't even thought about your pilot light going out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Your eyes don't lie to you, I'll tell you that much."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I take pride in keepin' it goin' on!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Here I am just talkin', and you don't even know my name."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm Winnifred! Nice to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice to meet you!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi, Whinny!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "It's a pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh, ehhhh. I don't really like nicknames from people I don't really know. Nothin' personal, darlin'. I hope you understand."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/c-6/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you just called me \"darlin\", so..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Shush now."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That wasn't no nickname. That was a pleasantry. Consider yourself lucky."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm not sure how much more talkin' I can do right now. I've got work to take care of."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is it you do?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Did you just ask your water heater what she does?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-2/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uhh..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-2/c-7/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean... I guess I did...?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "HAHAHAHAHAHA."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "It's okay, sweetness. I'm just having some fun."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, I do need to get back to work. Washford's about to kick on and Daisuke needs a bit of a push."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-3/33
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I need some time with River to make sure she's ready to go."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-3/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like hard work."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-3/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll come by later then!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I don't mind it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'll hold you to that, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_intro/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "See you 'round!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "There you are, sweetness. I was just thinkin' 'bout you!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? About me?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why was I on your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I told you to swing by and I was wondering if you were gonna."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm glad you did, because I just finished a shift. I have some time to spare if you wanna talk some."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You work a lot?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Depends on how up and about you are, really."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "The more you do, the more I gotta do."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm to blame for how much you do??"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no! I didn't know it was my fault!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Ain't nothin' nobody's fault. It's the kind of thing I love. I sit in here and I make sure everyone who needs some steamy attention gets it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "It's what I'm here to do!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Goodness, it's what I love to do!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How long have you been doing it?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Is this your sly way of asking how old I am?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-3/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "See, where I'm from, it's not polite to do that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-3/23
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Although, moving around by what people thought was polite and correct never really suited me anyway."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-3/31
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Let's just say I remember all the folks who stayed here before you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-3/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oooo! Got any secrets about them?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-3/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What were they like? If you don't mind telling me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-3/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Someone who likes the tea as hot as I do! Perfect!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-3/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "If you don't mind me talkin', I don't mind tellin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Truth is, one of the previous folks who stayed here were super cute."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Engaged couple. Beautiful together. Both of them were... well, can I give my honest opinion?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, please do!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd rather stick to the facts."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-4/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Neither one of them was as cute as you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Either way, they were here and they set up home pretty quickly. River and I both liked 'em. They brought so much life into this place."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "They took long showers together all the time. Just about tapped me dry, keepin' things hot up there for 'em."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Although, I hear they didn't really need my help to do that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hehehehe."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-3/25/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-6/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh yeah. You pickin' up what I'm saying!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "...bless your heart. Don't worry about it, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But they used to throw these big parties, too! Family was always over, and every now and then they had this little kid who would come play hide-and-seek."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Their favorite hiding spot was in here with me. So, I would just hum to them. I think they found bein' next to me safe."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hmm... I miss that little kid sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did something happen to them?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-8/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "What? No! The couple just moved out eventually."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-8/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You think about them often?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-8/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, when did this story become about me?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-8/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You don't need to worry yourself about who I do and don't be missin'. The past is the past, sweetheart. I don't live in that place."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-8/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You don't make it as long as I have dwellin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-8/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then why tell the stories?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-4/c-8/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sure do remember a lot of the past, though."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "There's a difference between knowing your history and livin' in it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Besides, you sayin' you didn't like my story?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I liked it a lot!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was okay, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-9/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well good. I enjoyed tellin' it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-5/c-10/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "See, keep talkin' like that, and I won't tell you the good ones."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Which reminds me of this one time where..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "No. You know what? I'mma wait for that one."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You wanna hear more, you gotta come back."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Besides, it's time I check in on my boy Washford."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-6/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I know Washford! Wait... you like him?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-6/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is Washford?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_first_encounter/0/g-6/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm... in love with Washford."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And you don't? What's not to like about that hunky man!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/8 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "He is just one of the hunkiest hunks that ever did hunk!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/19 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "The way he calls out to me when he needs some of what I've got."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/27 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/27 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/27
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, it's enough to get me bubblin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/35 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/43 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/43
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I bless the day you wheeled him into this house."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/43
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Drysdale's alright, but Washford?... mm mm MMM!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/51 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/59 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred fans herself with one hand, beginning to lose herself in her own fantasy."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/59
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I wouldn't mind going through a couple of cycles with him."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/67 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/83 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/75
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Ooop....."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_a/78
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I think I said too much!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/0 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh sweetheart."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/35
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You need to go introduce yourself to him right now!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/51
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "His stage partner's all right. You'll meet him, too. But Washford? ...mmm mm MMM!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/67
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I wouldn't mind going through a couple cycles with him."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_b/94 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/86
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I think I said too much! Hehe."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "He is just one of the hunkiest hunks that ever did hunk, isn't he?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You may be together... but the way he calls out to me when he needs some of what I've got."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/35
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You are one lucky human."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/51
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "His stage partner's cute, and maybe he's your kinda cute. But Washford? ...mmm mm MMM!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_crush_washford_c/67
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I wouldn't mind going through a couple cycles with him, if you're sharin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/0/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should know, Washford has a complicated something going on with Drysdale."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/1/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you sure Washford is available? Drysdale might have that one locked down."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "What? They got a thing going on?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "What kinda thang? Like, do you know the definition of this thang?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/g-0/16 winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I mean, I hear him talkin' 'bout Drysdale but, they are just stage partners."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/g-0/24 winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Right?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred lets out a sigh, shaking her head."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Look at me! Just as lost in thought as I wanna be."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Don't mind me, darlin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_a/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Sorry for thinkin' out loud."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh! I have met Washford. I forgot!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred shakes her head at you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "How you forget a hunk like that, I'll never know."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oooo, you lying. Right?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You gotta be lyin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "At least I hope you are, sweetness."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Surely if they were a pair, he would have told me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Not that he has to tell me anything. Just like he isn't owed anything from me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_revelation_b/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred sighs, somewhere else for a moment."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/first_encounter_wrapup/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well I think we better wrap this up for right now. I've got a social call to make."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/first_encounter_wrapup/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Thank you for listenin' to me spout about nonsense."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/first_encounter_wrapup/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, listen, I got more stories for you if you ever wanna hear 'em, I love sharing them with you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/first_encounter_wrapup/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'll see you around, sweetheart!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Look who just can't get enough of me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who, me?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "...yes you, sweetheart. I promise, sometimes you just about as dense as a drain pipe."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Not that I mind it. You're still pretty cute. Plus it feels like I can teach you somethin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd let you teach me a thing or two."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you know stuff about drain pipes?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "When you swing, you swing hard, don't ya?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Yes I do, but... you know what? Bless your heart."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "What brings you down here today?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And don't say drainage."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...drainage?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wanna know about things between you and Washford!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You told me you have more juicy stories."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hehehe. You smartass."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You came here for more stories, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Something told me that's what you wanted! Where did I leave off last."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh! Um... Washford and I..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred smiles, but it's not quite the same as her usual warm expression."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I know don't nobody really wanna hear about that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do! I really do!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, you're right. I actually don't."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I appreciate you asking me, sweetheart. It's very sweet. But, you just push that out your mind."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'll tell you another story, how about that?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred puts her hands on her hips—even her grumpy expression is darling."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That's rude, don't you know that? Gettin' me all worked up for what? A joke?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I promise, if you weren't so cute..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I should send you away for that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I have half a mind to."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-1/58
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred throws her hands in the air, a clear gesture of defeat."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_washford_rebuff/0/c-1/66
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh, how can I deny a face like that? I got another story to tell you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Okay, so remember what I told you about that couple taking long showers?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "There was this one time that —"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/19
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Hey Winnifred... oh. Uh..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/27
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "River!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/35
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...am I interrupting?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/43
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "No no, please. Come join us."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/51
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "How're you doin', sweetness?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River glares at you, giving you the distinct feeling she doesn't appreciate you being here... but she says nothing."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/67
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh, you know... fine. Same as always."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/75
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You say that every day... and I know that's not always true."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/83
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Winni... don't. Not now."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/91
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River looks away from both of you, steam rising from her cheeks as she blushes furiously."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/99
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That sweet little blush gets me every time."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/107
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But really, you had nothin' to be embarrassed about, darlin'. It's only me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/115
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "If you need a little help relaxin'..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/123/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello. I'm still here."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/124/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, isn't this cute!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh <i>god</i>. Not in front of somebody else, Winnie."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You really think I'd heat you up in front of an audience?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You keep blushin' like that I won't even have to—you're doin' a fine job all by yourself."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River's face is quite red, but no matter how much ribbing Winnifred gives her, she saves her annoyance for you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "River"
msgid "You seem busy. And I don't want to take you away from... talking."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well then, why don't you come by later? Sit with me for awhile?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River's voice is low and quiet—but you can still hear the heat in her words."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...you gonna warm me up?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/67
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You already know the answer to that, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/83
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Just wanna hear you say it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/91 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_realized/0/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh honey..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/99
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Why yes. Yes I <i>will</i> warm you up later."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/110
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...promise?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/118
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "If you give me a chance, I'll have you in a rolling boil."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/126
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River doesn't say anything, but the smile on her face says that Winnifred's words have hit home. Her body language changes, and she looks as if she wants to take a step closer..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/134
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But her eyes dart over to you, and she closes herself off again."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/142
msgctxt "River"
msgid "...I'll be back."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/150
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And I'll be waitin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/161/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What was that all about?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-0/162/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That got pretty steamy for a moment."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh that? That was... hehe, that was somethin', wasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know what? That's nothin' you need to be worrying yourself about, sweetheart."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "River and I go way back. Waaaaay back. She was the first one to come and speak to me when I got here."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "She's pretty special to me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you had a crush on Washford."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is more special? Washford or River?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you flirting with me, River, and Washford?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I wouldn't call it a crush, per say."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "...maybe I should call it a crush."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Even If it was a crush, which I don't think it is, there is a lot of subtle suggestion you got goin' on here."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, what kind of question is that, sweetheart?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "River and Washford are both so different and I think..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Bless your heart. You takin' my kindness for flirtin'. That's precious."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Yes, I may think you are one of the cutest things I ever did see."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Yes, I... did get excited that you came to see me today."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-1/c-6/31
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But I wouldn't call what I'm doin' flirtin'..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Wait a moment. Look at you, distracting me again."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm starting to expect you didn't come here for a story after all."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Look, I gotta go get ready for my visit with River."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sounded ready to me!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope Washford doesn't find out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want all the details."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You need to go on somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I have no idea what you are suggesting."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Why do you think that would matter?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Ah! I will not give you anything of the sort."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Besides, your imagination might be more fun."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know what, why don't you just go on ahead, and I'll see you later, alright sweetheart?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_river_one/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Go on now. Get goin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_third_encounter/0/0 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, look who's back!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_third_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Be honest this time. What made you slide way back this way?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_third_encounter/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Not that I mind seeing you again. Just curious."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_third_encounter/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You never did tell me that story."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_third_encounter/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm curious about you and River."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_third_encounter/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it a crime to come see someone so beautiful?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Ooooo, sweetheart. Do I have a story for <b>you!</b>"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "So, as I was tryin' to say before, they used to take this long shower together, right?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "So long that it was a struggle for me to keep things hot in there for 'em."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And I would hear laughin' and gigglin' and... sometimes other sounds that I'd rather not repeat."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oooo, spicy!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This IS a good story!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, there was one time that they got into a spat that lasted all night."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "See, what happened was one of them got on social media and liked someone else's photos."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And, not just one photo either. Nope. They liked 14 of 'em."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "When they were confronted, there was no denying it. Confessed right away. They knew they were in hot water."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Not like there was any point in lying about it. The proof was in the digital puddin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "They were made to sleep on the couch for about a week. The words <i>\"14 pictures\"</i> was being thrown their way for days."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "See, Phoenecia's up on all those apps, but I know that none of that stuff is real, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "If the cloud vanished tomorrow, so would those little thumbs up. But, their relationship would still be there."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/64
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, I thought for sure that was gonna be the end of them."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/72
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Can you believe that?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "14 photos?! They might as well be cheating!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like they weren't great at communicating."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants/0/g-0/82/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Psh. So? What's the big deal? They are just photos."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/6
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, hold on now. You really think so?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! Don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I think it can be more complicated than that. They are just photos online."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Wouldn't you ask questions about what is going on?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You might as well end it there. It's over!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Over?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "O-V-E-R."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, I think there is more to it than that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I could see how someone would be worried about something like that, though."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, honey, I'll tell you what. If I got worried every time someone I was interested in looked at someone else, I'd be boiling mad all the time."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you above jealousy or something?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you're lying to yourself."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh, I'll admit it, I get jealous like everyone else. I ain't above it. But take what River and I have for instance."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "While it is very complicated, River is her own liquid. Until we set boundaries and clear expectations, I can't be mad at her for pouring herself into another cup as well."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You get what I'm saying?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, I guess we don't know what was previously agreed upon."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred sighs, her shoulders sagging."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/c-0/18
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Okay well... I guess that's where you and I are gonna have to agree to disagree."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Exactly! So you do get it!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/c-1/18
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "It's the downside of being in here. I only ever hear the loud conversations."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/c-1/26
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Or the ones near pipes."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't say all that. I still think it's cheating."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/c-1/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh. I guess we just won't be in alignment on this one."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_a/0/g-1/24/c-1/34/c-0/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I knew you would. Everything comes down to communication."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "See, that right there is what I think the secret is."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I don't care who you are or what you thinkin' bout', you have to talk to your partner!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just like you've told River about Washford?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But that's easier said than done."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred narrows her eyes at you, but her expression remains sweet and playful."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, didn't nobody tell you to be nosey like that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Just because you cute don't mean you can say whatever you want now."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Besides, River and I..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Very true. Communication is difficult. But, I listen to folks all day. Mostly just wantin' something from me. But still, I listen!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Calm and open communication. Open the valve. Talk through it. That's what I say."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still... I don't think you should be liking other people's photos."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you care about someone, the least you owe them is a conversation."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh. Okay. Yeah, I can see how you would feel that way."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't agree? I think you're wrong about this."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Different strokes for different folks. I'd get too jealous."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/7 winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred looks disappointed in you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, that's one way to look at it, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Understandable."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-1/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "<i>...and noted.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I agree with you with my entire tank! You got the right idea!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-3/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you had a conversation with River? I mean, I know you like her."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-3/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just know it couldn't be me in that situation."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-3/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "...not yet. But I don't know if I have to."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_b/0/g-0/c-3/24/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Everyone has their tolerance levels with those things."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/6
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know, I was thinkin' the same thing the whole time."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/14
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm down here hearin' them carry on and just wonderin' why, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/22
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, I will say, I don't know the boundaries of their relationship."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/30
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Who knows what rules and regulations they choose to abide by when entering into courtship."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/38
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, I'll tell you what really bothered me about the whole thing."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/46
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "There felt like... some kind of unspoken expectation that wasn't being met."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/54
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That don't seem fair to either one of'em."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does River expect anything of you?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What expectations are you holding Washford to?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well... actually... I don't know."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_c/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh, so you got deep questions today!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Mmmhmmm. I knew that's why you came to talk with me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "How 'bout this. I'll let you ask one question about it. Anything you want."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well... ALMOST anything you want."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the line?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I ain't givin' you no details, I'll tell you that much."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll respect your boundaries."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I do appreciate that, honey."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "See, I knew all those things everyone else was saying about you was wrong."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "People have been saying things about me??"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So I'm the talk of the town?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm pullin' your leg. And even if they were, I wouldn't listen."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Life ain't about lettin' others tell you what to feel about people."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I like to make up my own mind about folks."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But I know you ain't here to listen about my philosophy. You have a question. What is it you want to know?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How long have you and River been a thing?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How much does Washford know about you and River?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/hot_water/0/g-0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Since you're talking to River... do I have a chance with you?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, I wouldn't say that we really a thing. Not in like the way that you think of a thing."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Which is not to say that I know what you consider a thing. But, from what you are sayin', you consider River and I to be a thing."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Really... honestly... it's complicated."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred's expression softens as she thinks about River. It takes her a few moments to find her words."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "River and I have been workin' so closely for so long, that things just kind of... clicked? I guess that's the word for it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "There are certain things in life you just click with. Those that just get you and what you are about and tryin' to do."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/48
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "River is one of those. And, honestly, she's made my job so much easier. I was warned that I could have ended up with super hard water."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/56
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But that's not River at all. Everything just flows between us."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/64
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "When you have that kind of flow, sometimes you just slide into things with each other. And that's what we've done."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/72
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "She's been there for me, and I've been there for her."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you in love with her?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you told River all of this?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh, you think you slick! I said one question and one question only. You don't like the answer?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/river_relationship_explained/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, it's my turn to ask a question."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm not sure what you mean by that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "River and I aren't together, really. Unless River and Washford spend their time talkin' about me, I'm not sure how much Washford knows about our social calls."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "The time I spend with Washford is about us. That's where I focus my attentions."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But... Washford and I haven't really got to spend too much time together. Not with Drysdale always around, getting into silly little arguments with him, I'm never really sure how he feels about me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/32 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know the artist type."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/40/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-0/32/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_realize_join/0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I sure do!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/41/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't, actually."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Then you get it!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well then, count your blessings. It can be pretty tough to figure out where Washford will land with you on any given day."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-0/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Still, there's somethin' about him. And it's not just his looks that get me goin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-0/8 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Whenever he talks to me, he's got me going every which way but loose."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-0/16 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, it's complicated, you know? He's complicated."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-0/24 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But I'm never one to back down from a challenge."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-0/35/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-1/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you trying to get serious with Washford?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-0/36/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-1/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How much of your feelings does he know?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-1/0 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, if I'm being honest —"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-1/8 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Wait a minute! Nope. That's another question."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-1/16 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "One question is all you get."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained/0/g-1/24 winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, it's my turn!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I don't think I have any expectations of him."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, that's not true."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I guess my expectation is that when we spend time together, I get his attention."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "In the same way as when I'm with him, ol' Winni ain't thinkin' 'bout nothin' or no one else."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, it ain't like Washford and I get a heck of a lot of time together."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it because of Drysdale?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "His stage partner is always right there! They bicker back and forth all the time. It's cute to watch... at first."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "After awhile though, you start to wonder why you're even standing there."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "So, I'm never really sure where I stand with Washford."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Then you get it, sweetheart!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Then count your blessings."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/washford_relationship_explained_b/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "It's hard figuring out where Washford and I are."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/6
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "OH SWEETHEART!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/14
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'll be honest, with all your snoopin' about my relationships, I thought you were just being nosey."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/22
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But now that I know it's 'cause you like me..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred smiles so warmly, the very air in the room heats up."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/38
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Listen, I'll tell you somethin'. My heart isn't really bound to any one somebody, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/46
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "While you and I have just met, you know... I need more time to warm up to you..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/54
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You've still got a shot, sweetheart."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/62
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I know I'm hot, but I'll try not to burn you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/70
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "How that sound?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/78/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do I have to do to get to your heart?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really think I have a chance with you?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I thought we agreed on one question. Hehe."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That's just somethin' you're gonna have to find out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "The deal was a single question. You either trust me, or you don't."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/player_relationship_explained/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now... I get to ask you somethin', don't I?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/warming_up/0/6
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You are just... somethin' else!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/warming_up/0/14
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "No, it's not a crime to come and see me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/warming_up/0/22
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Although, I could have you detained for tryin' to be slick!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/warming_up/0/30
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hehehe."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/warming_up/0/38
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, us just lookin' at each other ain't my idea of a good time."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/warming_up/0/46
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Surely there is somethin' else you came down here to talk to me about."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/warming_up/0/54/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The deets about you and River!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/warming_up/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You still owe me a story."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/question_the_player/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, since you wanna be diggin' for gold in my pan, I got a question for you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/question_the_player/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Have you ever liked more than one person at a time?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/question_the_player/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Never. It gets too complicated for me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/question_the_player/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's happened to me before, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/question_the_player/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, all the time."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/question_the_player/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's happening right now!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/no_multiple/6
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now that's an easy answer for you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/no_multiple/14
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That kinda surprises me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/no_multiple/22
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "The heart is a complicated thing and often, I find it likes being that way."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/no_multiple/30
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "No matter how much we try to sort it out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/no_multiple/38
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, you seem like you've got it all together. Which is awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/maybe_multiple/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Really. And uhh... what did you do about it?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/maybe_multiple/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I kinda let it ride. It'll all shake out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/maybe_multiple/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I pick one person to focus on and drop the others."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/maybe_multiple/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "See, I like that. You let your heart do what it needs to do."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/maybe_multiple/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/maybe_multiple/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know how you handle the situation when it comes up, and that's really what matters."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/yes_multiple/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred nods, confident and pleased with herself."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/yes_multiple/0/14
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I knew it. Somethin' just told me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/yes_multiple/0/25
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You look like someone with the capacity to hold affection for a lot of people inside you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/yes_multiple/0/33
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "When you find yourself in these situations, what do you do?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/yes_multiple/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll eventually narrow down to one."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/yes_multiple/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I let my heart guide me. I don't put limits on it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/yes_multiple/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The more the merrier, as far as I'm concerned!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/yes_multiple/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh, so you've figured out where it all sits with you. Yeah, that's the important part."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/3
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Winnif- ...ah."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/11
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Company again?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I think we were just wrapping up, actually."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/27
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh, alright. Well... I have a message for you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/35
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "From who? Washford?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/43
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Oh no no no. This one is from..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks over at you, but when Winnifred doesn't object, she just shrugs."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/62
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Bathsheba."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/70
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh! Well, I... wait, you sure it's from Bathsheba?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/78
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Wouldn't say it if I wasn't sure."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/86
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/94
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Come on, Win... bad enough I have to play messenger between you two."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/102
msgctxt "River"
msgid "She said she has something important to say to you and that you should..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/110
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Shake the pipes and give her a call."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/118
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Okay! I'll do just that!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/129
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "River looks relieved to be done, though still grumpy about her assignment."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/137
msgctxt "River"
msgid "Well... whatever. See you later."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/145
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know where to find me!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/156/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bathsheba, too! Damn, girl!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/157/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooooooo, Winny!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/158/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bathsheba wants you too? You go, Winnifred!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "What? I have no idea what you're talkin' about, sweetheart."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hey now! You can't call me Winny. Only Washford can... and maybe River and Bathsheba. But not you, darlin!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hehehe. When you're hot, you're hot!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Why don't you head on out? I ain't trying to kick you out, but I'd just rather take this conversation in private."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/third_encounter_wrapup/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'll see you around, sweetheart."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You keep comin' in here lookin' for me. I'm startin' to think you like talkin' to me or somethin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe so."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't get so full of yourself."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course! How else am I gonna win your hand?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Tryin' to play coy. I'll say, it works for you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Woah now! You wanna keep talkin' to me, I'mma need you to be sweet to me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Keep talkin' like that, you just might!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Look, I know I've been tellin' you about that couple that lived here before."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well... I wanna tell you why they moved out. Is that alright?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Story time with you is always great."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oooo, some tea. Pour it!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, let me start by saying these two people really loved each other."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But... what happened next really shook things up for me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "They had a birthday party here. I was workin' double duty that day."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "It was what I would call a barn burner. I mean, they went on late into the night."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "The music was great, everyone was having a good time."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But then... someone turned on the shower. I thought it was just those lovely tenants just wantin' to be clean after the shindig."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I heard their voices, but... then I heard another."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A third voice?!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "OOOoooOOOooo."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They came to party, didn't they?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And it was a long shower, too. But, that ain't the point."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "The point is, after that... the arguing started pickin' up."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I heard a name get tossed around that I ain't heard before."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And then, one day when they were down here by my closet door, they started fussin' and fightin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Then a question was asked."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "\"Who do you love more? Them or me?\""
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-2/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was that serious?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That's not where things went downhill."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "The response they got was -"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "\"Can't I love you both?\""
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happened then?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "There was no response."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That was a silence thicker than molasses on a cold day."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/23
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Their shared showers was stopped. Within two weeks, they were packing boxes and gettin' ready to move out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That is such a sad story."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh wow. What a bummer."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, they didn't cheat or anything. Don't you think they should work it out?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't love more than one person."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They weren't having good communication. No way it was going to work."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/c-0/13 winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred looks as if she's been slapped—there's genuine hurt in her eyes."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Ahh... I understand now."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But yeah... that's really all I wanted to tell you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I think you right, darlin'. I can't really place blame on either of them. They just weren't on the same page."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Broke my heart when they left, though. They seemed so happy for so long."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Made me wonder if it was even possible to..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred trails off, lost in a thought she doesn't share with you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_a/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know what? Nevermind."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I know, it broke my heart to watch it happen."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I really wish they could have worked it out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's no way. You can't love more than one person."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wish they would have talked about their feelings more."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you can love more than one person. It just takes more work."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "...huh. Yeah... I guess not."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Me too. You know, I wish you could have met 'em. They were lovely."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Sorry... I always get a little nostalgic when I think about 'em."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred's eyebrows raise, her expression a mix of surprise and appreciation. She looks at you in a way that makes you feel like she's just seeing you for the first time."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You really feel that way?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/previous_tenants_wrapup_b/0/c-2/35
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Well, that's just... heh. I appreciate you sayin' that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter_wrapup/4
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hmm... Y'know I've got some thinkin' to do. You mind coming around some other time?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_fourth_encounter_wrapup/12
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I appreciate you as always, darlin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hey there. If it ain't just the person I want to see!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now you wanna see me, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I knew you couldn't resist this charm."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You have grown on me, I will say that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But... I'm plannin' on somethin' big and I want your help."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I think... I've gotta talk to Bathsheba, River, and Washford."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All together!?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I knew you liked them all!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Only one by one, actually."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Heh. I don't think I did a very good job at hiding it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "When the previous tenants moved out, I was shut off from everyone."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Even River couldn't come see me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "It was then that I realized how much I missed them."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Once you showed up and I could connect with River and Bathsheba again -"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And I met Washford..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That's when I really started to think about how much I was capable of giving."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That time when I was cut off from everything was lonely. But, baby, I've got so much to give."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And I wanna give it to those who wanna respect it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/64
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I think those three... they mean too much to me not to figure out what we are to each other."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/72
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, before I talk to them... I wanted to talk to you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-1/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I've... really enjoyed you coming down here to see me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And while a lot of that time was just you tryin' to pry information out of me..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You also showed me that someone could like multiple people at the same time."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And it's okay!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know, I didn't feel like I was allowed to before I met you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And now, why I'm incredibly comfortable with... me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-2/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a really sweet thing to say!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-2/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so glad I could help!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But... that ain't it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I've been... thinkin' about you lately."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And while you said, you know, 'I like some other folks...'"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I've really grown to like you, too."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh, I'm so nervous right now. I can feel myself rattlin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/43
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "All this to say that, I was wonderin' if..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/51
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You would consider tryin' to figure out whatever it is we've got between us?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_flirting/0/g-3/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think that's really for me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/double_check/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Even if... the others are involved?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/double_check/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It'll be hard, but we'll work it out."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/double_check/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As long as I have you, I'll be happy."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/double_check/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know... maybe not."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hey sweetheart! How's it been going?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Better now that I'm with you!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I figured I was gone long enough for you to miss me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Flatterer. That's what's gonna be on your tombstone."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Is that so? Maybe a few more days will do it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm kiddin'!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm actually really glad you came."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Truth is, our last conversation made me realize somethin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I think... no, I know... I need to talk to River, Washford, and Bathsheba."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm proud of you!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh goodness. That'll be stressful."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Only reason I have the gumption to do so is because of you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I know that there is a place for the way that I feel love."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "It is just gonna take a whole lot of work and communication. Which... I ain't been too great at."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Truthfully, I'm usually so concerned about what other things need from me, I ain't spent too much time thinkin' 'bout what I want from them."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And... I want somethin' with them."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I hope they want somethin' with me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you think that's kinda greedy?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about you and me?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_friendzone/0/g-1/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad I could help you get there! That's what friends are for!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred is stunned, but it doesn't last long—her eyes grow dark, and her lip trembles for a moment as she processes your words."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Greedy?! What are you..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I ain't being greedy!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/35
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And honestly, you've got some nerve..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/43
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Telling you all that wasn't easy you know! And your response? Disrespectful."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/51
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Here I was thinking we were closer than that."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/59
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, at least I know where we stand now."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/67
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "So if you don't mind, I'd like it if you left."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/75
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Gots me so boilin' mad I don't know what to do."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/86
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred draws herself up to her full height, looking at you with a gaze shockingly frigid for a water heater. You've never seen her so closed off and angry."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/94
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll still do my job."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_a/102
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I just don't need you comin' round here to distract me no more."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_greedy_tunnel/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred gestures wildly with her hands, pointing at you, the rest of the room, and then back at you again. You've never seen her so furious."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_greedy_tunnel/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Look at yourself! You're going around loving everything around here and you think you've got a pipe to stand on?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_greedy_tunnel/22
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm steaming something fierce with your insolence. Calm yourself, Winni..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_greedy_tunnel/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She takes a moment to herself, breathing in and out, but it only just seems to take the edge off her anger."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Don't worry, I know how you feel about all of this."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Which is why I... I don't think I can keep talkin' to you about this stuff."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I've worked really hard to come to terms with the fact that my heart wants something different than most."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And I'm extremely nervous about puttin' myself out there as it is. Then you come along with your..."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You know what, darlin'? None of that matters."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I appreciate you listenin' to me the way you have. I really do."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/48
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But, this and all other matters of my heart can't be shared with you."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're cutting me out?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you think you're being dramatic?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'm sorry. This is just how I feel."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But don't worry, I'm gonna keep doin' my job. I'm not unprofessional."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But it'll just be that from now on. Professional."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now, if you'll excuse me, darlin'... I'd like to be alone."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred turns away from you, giving you one last hurt look over her shoulder."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_b/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh and if you could please close the closet door on the way out, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_hate_joiner/22
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Great job - you simmered any heat between you two way down."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Oh, darlin'. Can I be honest."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "You've been a really good friend, and fun to talk to."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And I enjoy the time we've been spendin' together."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But... I don't think you and I are exactly on the same page with what we're looking for."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I'd rather make sure our friendship stays strong than anything else."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "That sounded super \"it's not you, it's me\" but, I really do think it'll be for the best."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/48
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I really do appreciate you, darlin'. I don't want you to think otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/56/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/32/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate you too!"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/57/s/0 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/32/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you for your honesty."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/g-0/0 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Let me tell you something, you will always have a friend in me."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/g-0/8 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Now... if you'll excuse me, I have some conversations to prepare."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/g-0/16 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "No idea when I'll talk to 'em, but it'll be soon."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/g-0/24 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "And thank you for helpin' me navigate all of this."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/g-0/32 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Even when you weren't aware that that's what you were doin'."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/g-0/40 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Listen, I really hope you swing by sometime soon, okay sweetness?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_a/0/g-0/48 winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I better see you around, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I cherish you. I really do."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Truth be told, when I was talkin' to you, I didn't realize I was untanglin' all my feelings."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/16
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "But you were a consistent ear through it all."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/24
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Not sure I could have asked for a better friend to help me with all of this."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/Winnifred_friendship_b/0/32/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "I really do appreciate you, darlin'. Don't you think otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_disconnect/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Winnifred seems miles away when you see her, her usual smile replaced by a somber sort of expression."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_disconnect/0/8
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_disconnect/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just... hey?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_disconnect/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? No \"darlin'\" today?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_disconnect/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Winnifred"
msgid "Sorry if I ain't being very welcoming right now. I got a lot on my mind."
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_disconnect/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You wanna tell me?"
msgstr ""

#: winnifred_waterheater/waterheater_disconnect/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talk to me about it!"
msgstr ""

